230	     * registration date defaults to today. Field-level rejections are reported here
231	     * rather than inline in {@link #addOwner}, and normalisation runs before any
232	     * household comparison so those comparisons see the canonical values.
233	     *
234	     * @param owner the freshly-mapped owner to normalise
235	     * @return {@code true} if the fields are valid, or {@code false} if the address
236	     *         is blank after normalisation or the telephone cannot form a valid
237	     *         E.164 number, in which case the request must be rejected with
238	     *         {@code 400 Bad Request}
239	     */
